Untwist is a reimplementation of webcrack (https://github.com/j4k0xb/webcrack)
in Rust. Its pass behaviour is compatible with or ported from webcrack, and the
fixtures under fixtures/reference/ are taken from webcrack. webcrack is licensed
under the MIT License:

    Copyright (c) 2023 j4k0xb

The full webcrack license text is in fixtures/LICENSE-reference.

vendor/regress is a fork of regress (https://github.com/ridiculousfish/regress)
by ridiculousfish, licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0; its license files are in
that directory.
